				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body" aria-labelledby="firstHeading" data-mw-ve-target-container>
					<div class="vector-body-before-content">
							<div class="mw-indicators">
		</div>

						<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia</div>
						<div id="contentSub"><div id="mw-content-subtitle"></div></div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha27" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><p id="mwAg"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1" id="mwAw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"none"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description" about="#mwt1"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata" about="#mwt1" id="mwBA"/>
In <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Written_Chinese" title="Written Chinese" id="mwBQ">written Chinese</a>, components (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language" title="Chinese language" about="#mwt2" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"部件"},"p":{"wt":"bùjiàn"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt2">:</span><span about="#mwt2"> </span><span lang="zh" about="#mwt2"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>部件</span><span about="#mwt2">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt2">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt2">:</span><span about="#mwt2"> </span><i about="#mwt2" id="mwBw"><span lang="zh-Latn">bùjiàn</span></i>) are building blocks of characters, composed of strokes.<sup about="#mwt3" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091_1-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20091"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"1"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1" id="mwCA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCg">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCw">]</span></span></a></sup> 
In most cases, a component consists of more than one stroke and is smaller than the whole of the character. For example, the character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt6" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"件"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>件</span> consists of two components: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt7" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"亻"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>亻</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt8" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"牛"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>牛</span>. These can be further decomposed: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt9" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"亻"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>亻</span> can be analyzed as the sequence of strokes <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt10" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓㇑</span>, and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt11" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"牛"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>牛</span> as the sequence <span lang="und-Hani" about="#mwt12" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"hani","href":"./Template:Hani"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"㇓㇐㇐㇑"}},"i":0}}]}'>㇓㇐㇐㇑</span>.<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201484–85_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201484–85"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201484–85-2"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"pp":{"wt":"84-85"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201484–85-2" id="mwEw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFQ">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwFw">There are two methods for Chinese character component analysis, <i id="mwGA">hierarchical dividing</i> and <i id="mwGQ">plane dividing</i>. Hierarchical dividing separates layer by layer from larger to smaller components, and finally gets the primitive components. Plane dividing separates out the primitive components at one time.<sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201486_3-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201486"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"86"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3" id="mwGg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwHg">The structure of a Chinese character is the pattern or rule in which the character is formed by its (first level) components.<sup about="#mwt19" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092_4-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20092"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4" id="mwHw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIQ">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">]</span></span></a></sup> Chinese character structures include single-component structure, left–right structure, up–down structure and surrounding structure.<sup about="#mwt22" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFu19992_5-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFu19992"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu19992-5"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Fu"},"2":{"wt":"1999"},"p":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu19992-5" id="mwIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJQ">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwJw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwKA" aria-labelledby="Analysis"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Analysis">Analysis</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Analysis"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwKQ">Chinese characters may be analyzed in terms of smaller components. This analysis is generally based on graphical forms, without considering aspects like pronunciation and meaning.<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201486_3-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201486"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"86"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3" id="mwKg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwLg">Component analysis is very helpful for learning Chinese characters. For example:</p>
<ul id="mwLw"><li id="mwMA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt28" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"想"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>想</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt29" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt30" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"心"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span></li>
<li id="mwNA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt31" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwNQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"湘"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>湘</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt32" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwNg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"氵"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>氵</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt33" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwNw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span></li>
<li id="mwOA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt34" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwOQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt35" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwOg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"木"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>木</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt36" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwOw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span></li></ul>
<p id="mwPA">Through component analysis, one may learn characters in an easier way. If a student learns <span lang="zh" about="#mwt37" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwPQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span> first, the knowledge will help with the learning or review of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt38" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwPg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"想"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>想</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt39" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwPw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"湘"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>湘</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt40" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwQA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"木"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>木</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt41" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwQQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>. Obviously, learning by component analysis is much more efficient than learning by analyzing each character to strokes. Component analysis is also used in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_encoding" title="Chinese character encoding" id="mwQg">Chinese character encoding</a> for computer input.<sup about="#mwt42" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFu199918_6-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFu199918"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199918-6"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Fu"},"2":{"wt":"1999"},"p":{"wt":"18"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199918-6" id="mwQw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRQ">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwRw">There are two methods for Chinese character dividing, <i id="mwSA">hierarchical dividing</i> and <i id="mwSQ">plane dividing</i>. Hierarchical dividing separates layer by layer from large to small components, and finally gets the primitive components. Plane dividing separates out the primitive components at one time. Hierarchical dividing can display the external structure of Chinese characters, while plane splitting can be regarded as omitting the higher splitting levels, and directly writing out the final separating result of primitive components.<sup about="#mwt45" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201486_3-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201486"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"86"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-3" id="mwSg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwTg" aria-labelledby="Rules_for_division"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Rules_for_division">Rules for division</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Rules for division"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwTw">The rules for hierarchical dividing include:<sup about="#mwt48" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201486-88_7-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201486-88"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-88-7"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"86-88"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201486-88-7" id="mwUA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUg">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwVA"><li id="mwVQ">The <i id="mwVg">separation space ditch/gap</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt51" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwVw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"分割沟"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>分割沟</span>) is an obvious boundary, where the character (or bigger component) is split into (smaller) components.</li>
<li id="mwWA">If there is only one separation ditch, split into two components along the separation ditch. For example: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt52" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"私"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>私</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt53" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"禾"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>禾</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt54" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"厶"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>厶</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt55" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwXA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"兵"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>兵</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt56" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwXQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"丘"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>丘</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt57" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwXg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span>.</li>
<li id="mwXw">When there is more than one separation ditch, divide along the longer one first. For example: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt58" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwYA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"想"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>想</span>→ <span lang="zh" about="#mwt59" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwYQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt60" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwYg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"心，"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心，</span> <span lang="zh" about="#mwt61" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwYw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt62" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwZA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"木"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>木</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt63" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwZQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>, to get the hierarchical structure of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt64" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwZg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"想"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>想</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt65" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwZw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"相"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt66" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwaA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"木"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>木</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt67" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwaQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>)+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt68" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwag" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"心"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span>) with two layers of components.</li>
<li id="mwaw">When several separation ditches are parallel and equal in length, divide along all of them. For example: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt69" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwbA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"鴻"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>鴻</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt70" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwbQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"氵"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>氵</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt71" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwbg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"工"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt72" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwbw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"鳥"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>鳥</span>.</li>
<li id="mwcA">Intersecting stroke groups are not divided, for example, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt73" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwcQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"車"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>車</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt74" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwcg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"车"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>车</span> are primitive components.</li>
<li id="mwcw">The lower bound of dividing is generally greater than single strokes, and components with only two strokes, such as "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt75" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwdA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"二八刁"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>二八刁</span>", are not to be separated.</li>
<li id="mwdQ">Hierarchical analysis should conform to the basic structure of Chinese characters. For example: the outermost layer of "<span lang="zh" about="#mwt76" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwdg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"謎"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>謎</span>" is in a left-right structure, so the left and right separation is employed first: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt77" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwdw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"謎"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>謎</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt78" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mweA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"訁"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>訁</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt79" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mweQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"迷"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>迷</span>, followed by the inside-outside division (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt80" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mweg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"迷"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>迷</span>→<span lang="zh" about="#mwt81" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwew" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"辶"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>辶</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt82" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwfA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"米"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>米</span>), although the latter's L-shaped separation ditch may be longer.</li>
<li id="mwfQ">A character containing multi-level components are divided from larger to smaller sizes to generate first-level components, second-level components, third-level components, etc.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwfg" aria-labelledby="An_example"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="An_example">An example</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: An example"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwfw">The hierarchical analysis of character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt83" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"戇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span> in (1) bracketed representation:</p>

<pre id="mwgQ"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt84" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"戇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt85" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwgw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"贛"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>贛</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt86" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwhA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"章"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>章</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt87" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwhQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"立"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>立</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt88" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwhg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"早"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>早</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt89" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwhw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"日"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt90" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwiA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"十"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>))+(⿱<span lang="zh" about="#mwt91" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwiQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"夂貢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂貢</span>)(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt92" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwig" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"夂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt93" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwiw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"貢"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貢</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt94" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"工"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt95" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"貝"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貝</span>(<span lang="zh" about="#mwt96" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt97" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwjw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span>))))+<span lang="zh" about="#mwt98" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwkA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"心"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span>),<sup about="#mwt99" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":" \"(⿱{{lang-zh|夂貢|labels=no}})\" represents the right component of {{zhi|c=贛}}, which is not displayable in Unicode"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-8" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwkQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwkg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkw">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlA">]</span></span></a></sup> 5 layers of components.</pre>
<p id="mwlQ">or in tree structure:</p>
<pre id="mwlg">                    <span lang="zh" about="#mwt102" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwlw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"戇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span>
                  /    \
                <span lang="zh" about="#mwt103" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwmA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"贛"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>贛</span>       <span lang="zh" about="#mwt104" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwmQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"心"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span>
              /    \
             <span lang="zh" about="#mwt105" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwmg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"章"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>章</span>    (⿱<span lang="zh" about="#mwt106" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwmw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"夂貢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂貢</span>)
            /  \    /  \
           <span lang="zh" about="#mwt107" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwnA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"立"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>立</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt108" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwnQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"早"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>早</span>  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt109" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwng" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"夂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt110" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwnw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"貢"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貢</span>
              /  \     /  \
             <span lang="zh" about="#mwt111" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwoA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"日"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt112" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwoQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"十"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt113" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwog" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"工"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt114" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwow" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"貝"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貝</span>
                         /  \
                        <span lang="zh" about="#mwt115" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt116" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwpQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span></pre>

<p id="mwpg">The level to which a Chinese character is to be analyzed or divided depends on actual applications.</p>

<p id="mwpw">In plane analysis, only components on the tree-leaves are presented, i.e., </p>
<pre id="mwqA"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt117" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"戇"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span>: <span lang="zh" about="#mwt118" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"立"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>立</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt119" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwqw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"日"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt120" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwrA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"十"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt121" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwrQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"夂"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt122" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwrg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"工"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt123" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwrw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"目"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt124" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwsA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"八"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span>,<span lang="zh" about="#mwt125" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwsQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"心"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span>.</pre>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwsg" aria-labelledby="Analysis_data_of_the_Cihai"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Analysis_data_of_the_Cihai">Analysis data of the <i id="mwsw">Cihai</i></h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Analysis data of the Cihai"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwtA">The following is the analysis data of <i id="mwtQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cihai" title="Cihai" id="mwtg">Cihai</a></i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt126" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwtw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"辭海"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>辭海</span>), with a character set of 16,339 traditional and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" id="mwuA">simplified Chinese characters</a>.<sup about="#mwt127" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFu199925_9-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFu199925"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199925-9"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Fu"},"2":{"wt":"1999"},"p":{"wt":"25"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199925-9" id="mwuQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwug"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwuw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwvA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwvQ">
<caption id="mwvg"><b id="mwvw"><i id="mwwA">Cihai</i> Traditional and Simplified Chinese Character component analysis</b></caption>
<tbody id="mwwQ"><tr id="mwwg">
<th id="mwww">component level</th>
<th id="mwxA">different components</th>
<th id="mwxQ">total components</th></tr>
<tr id="mwxg">
<td id="mwxw">1</td>
<td id="mwyA">3061</td>
<td id="mwyQ">32065</td></tr>
<tr id="mwyg">
<td id="mwyw">2</td>
<td id="mwzA">1302</td>
<td id="mwzQ">34296</td></tr>
<tr id="mwzg">
<td id="mwzw">3</td>
<td id="mw0A">539</td>
<td id="mw0Q">16777</td></tr>
<tr id="mw0g">
<td id="mw0w">4</td>
<td id="mw1A">195</td>
<td id="mw1Q">3872</td></tr>
<tr id="mw1g">
<td id="mw1w">5</td>
<td id="mw2A">48</td>
<td id="mw2Q">396</td></tr>
<tr id="mw2g">
<td id="mw2w">6</td>
<td id="mw3A">12</td>
<td id="mw3Q">184</td></tr>
<tr id="mw3g">
<td id="mw3w">7</td>
<td id="mw4A">3</td>
<td id="mw4Q">6</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p id="mw4g">In most cases, a component is larger than a stroke and smaller than the whole character (combines with some other components to form the character). The condition for a single stroke to be a component is:  occupies a relatively independent location usually occupied by a multiple-stroke component in a character. For example: the top stroke <span lang="zh" about="#mwt130" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw4w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"一"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt131" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"元"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>元</span>, the bottom <span lang="zh" about="#mwt132" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"一"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一</span> in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt133" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"旦"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>旦</span>, the left <span lang="zh" about="#mwt134" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw5w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"丨"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>丨</span> in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt135" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"旧"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>旧</span>, the right ㇟ in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt136" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"礼"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>礼</span>, the central ㇔ in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt137" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"勺"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>勺</span>, and the outer ㇆ in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt138" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw6w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"司"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>司</span>. In the special cases of one-stroke characters, such as <span lang="zh" about="#mwt139" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"一"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>一</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt140" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw7Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zhi","href":"./Template:Zhi"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"乙"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>乙</span>, a stroke is a component and is a character.<sup about="#mwt141" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTESu201485_10-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTESu201485"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201485-10"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Su"},"2":{"wt":"2014"},"p":{"wt":"85"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTESu201485-10" id="mw7g"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mw7w"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mw8A">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mw8Q">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mw8g" aria-labelledby="Classification_of_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Classification_of_components">Classification of components</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Classification of components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mw8w" aria-labelledby="Character_components_and_non-character_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Character_components_and_non-character_components">Character components and non-character components</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Character components and non-character components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mw9A">A component that can independently form a character is a character component, or a <i id="mw9Q">component of independent character formation</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt144" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw9g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"成字部件"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>成字部件</span>). For example, component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt145" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw9w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"口"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>口</span> formed character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt146" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"口"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>口</span> independently, and is a component in characters <span lang="zh" about="#mwt147" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"另"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>另</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt148" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"洁"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>洁</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt149" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw-w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"唱"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>唱</span>; and component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt150" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_A" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"相"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相</span> is also a character by itself, and a component in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt151" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_Q" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"湘"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>湘</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt152" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_g" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"箱"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>箱</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt153" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mw_w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"想"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>想</span>.<sup about="#mwt154" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20091"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"1"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1" id="mwAQA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAQE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAQI">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAQM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAQQ">A component that can not independently form a character is a non-character component, or a <i id="mwAQU">component of dependent character formation</i> (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt157" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"非成字部件"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>非成字部件</span>). For example, component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt158" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"冂"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>冂</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt159" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"同"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>同</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt160" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"钢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>钢</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt161" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"岗"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>岗</span>; and component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt162" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"疒"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>疒</span> in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt163" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"疾"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>疾</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt164" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"病"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>病</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt165" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"痛"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>痛</span>. Neither <span lang="zh" about="#mwt166" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAQ8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"冂"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>冂</span> nor  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt167" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"疒"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>疒</span> is a character in modern Chinese.<sup about="#mwt168" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091_1-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20091"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"1"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20091-1" id="mwARE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwARI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwARM">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwARQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwARU" aria-labelledby="Primitive_components_and_Compound_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Primitive_components_and_Compound_components">Primitive components and Compound components</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Primitive components and Compound components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwARY">A component that cannot be (further) divided into smaller components by the rules is a primitive component, or basic component (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt171" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"基礎部件"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>基礎部件</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt172" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"基础部件"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>基础部件</span>). Primitive components are the final-level components of hierarchical dividing. For example, components <span lang="zh" about="#mwt173" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"田"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>田</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt174" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"力"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>力</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt175" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"男"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>男</span>, and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt176" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwARw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"氵"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>氵</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt177" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAR0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"河"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>河</span>.<sup about="#mwt178" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092_4-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20092"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4" id="mwAR4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAR8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwASA">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwASE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwASI">A component composed of two or more primitive components is a compound component (<span lang="zh" about="#mwt181" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"合成部件"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>合成部件</span>). For example, component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt182" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"咅 (立+口)"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>咅 (立+口)</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt183" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"陪"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>陪</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt184" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"部"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>部</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt185" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"菩"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>菩</span>, and component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt186" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"相 (木+目)"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>相 (木+目)</span> in <span lang="zh" about="#mwt187" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"厢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>厢</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt188" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"霜"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>霜</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt189" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwASs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"孀"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>孀</span>.<sup about="#mwt190" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092_4-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20092"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4" id="mwASw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAS0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAS4">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAS8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwATA" aria-labelledby="Hierarchy_of_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Hierarchy_of_components">Hierarchy of components</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Hierarchy of components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwATE">A component divided out at the first level is called a level-one component, a component divided out at the second level is called a level-two component, and so on. A component divided out at the final level is called a final-level component, i.e., primitive component. For example, in the example of character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt193" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"戇"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span>,</p>
<pre id="mwATM">                   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt194" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"戇"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>戇</span>
                 /    \
               <span lang="zh" about="#mwt195" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"贛"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>贛</span>       <span lang="zh" about="#mwt196" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"心"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span> (level-one components)
             /    \
            <span lang="zh" about="#mwt197" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"章"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>章</span>    (⿱<span lang="zh" about="#mwt198" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"夂貢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂貢</span>) (level-two components)
           /  \    /  \
          <span lang="zh" about="#mwt199" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"立"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>立</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt200" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"早"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>早</span>  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt201" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"夂"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt202" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"貢"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貢</span> (level-three components)
             /  \     /  \
            <span lang="zh" about="#mwt203" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAT0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"日"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt204" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAT4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"十"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt205" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAT8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"工"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>  <span lang="zh" about="#mwt206" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"貝"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>貝</span> (level-four components)
                        /  \
                       <span lang="zh" about="#mwt207" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"目"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>   <span lang="zh" about="#mwt208" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"八"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span> (level-five components)</pre>

<p id="mwAUM">where the leaf components <span lang="zh" about="#mwt209" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"立"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>立</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt210" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"日"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt211" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"十"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>十</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt212" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"夂"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>夂</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt213" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"工"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>工</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt214" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"目"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>目</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt215" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"八"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>八</span> and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt216" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAUs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"心"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>心</span> are final-level components or primitive components.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwAUw" aria-labelledby="Single-stroke_components_and_multi-stroke_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Single-stroke_components_and_multi-stroke_components">Single-stroke components and multi-stroke components</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Single-stroke components and multi-stroke components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAU0">A component formed by one stroke is called a single-stroke component. For example, 
stroke ㇐ in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt217" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAU4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丛"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>丛</span>, stroke ㇑ in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt218" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAU8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"引"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>引</span>, stroke ㇓ in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt219" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"系"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>系</span>, stroke ㇔ in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt220" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"良"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>良</span>, stroke ㇆ in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt221" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"司"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>司</span>.<sup about="#mwt222" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092_4-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTENational Language Commission20092"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"National Language Commission"},"2":{"wt":"2009"},"p":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTENational_Language_Commission20092-4" id="mwAVM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAVQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAVU">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAVY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAVc">A component formed by more than one stroke is called a multi-stroke component. For example,
component <span lang="zh" about="#mwt225" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"从"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>从</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt226" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"丛"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>丛</span>, <span lang="zh" about="#mwt227" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"弓"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>弓</span> in character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt228" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"引"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>引</span>, and <span lang="zh" about="#mwt229" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAVw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"艮"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>艮</span> of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt230" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAV0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"良"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>良</span>.</p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwAV4" aria-labelledby="Primitive_components"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Primitive_components">Primitive components</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Chinese_character_components&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: Primitive components"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwAV8">Among the 16,339 traditional, simplified and unsimplified characters in <i id="mwAWA">Cihai</i>, there are 675 primitive components; among the 11,834 characters excluding the simplified traditional characters, there are 648 primitive components.<sup about="#mwt231" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEFu199926_11-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTEFu199926"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199926-11"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Fu"},"2":{"wt":"1999"},"p":{"wt":"26"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEFu199926-11" id="mwAWE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAWI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWM">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWQ">]</span></span></a></sup> 
In <i id="mwAWU">Chinese Character Information Dictionary</i>,<sup about="#mwt234" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTELi19881027_12-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"","name":"FOOTNOTELi19881027"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTELi19881027-12"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"sfn","href":"./Template:Sfn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Li"},"2":{"wt":"1988"},"p":{"wt":"1027"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTELi19881027-12" id="mwAWY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAWc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWg">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWk">]</span></span></a></sup> among the 7,785 China Mainland standard characters, a total of 623 primitive components have been divided out.</p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwAWo">
<caption id="mwAWs"><b id="mwAWw">Primitive components with the most character combinations in <i id="mwAW0">Cihai</i></b></caption>
<tbody id="mwAW4"><tr id="mwAW8">
<th id="mwAXA">serial number</th>
<th id="mwAXE">components</th>
<th id="mwAXI">characters composed</th>
<th id="mwAXM">frequency</th></tr>
<tr id="mwAXQ">
<td id="mwAXU">1</td>
<td id="mwAXY"><span lang="zh" about="#mwt237" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAXc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"口"},"labels":{"wt":"no"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>口</span></td>
<td id="mwAXg">2409</td>
<td id="mwAXk">20.3579%</td></tr>
<tr id="mwAXo">
